<title>SPAIN: Spain ICO to issue 15 bln pta in 29-1/2 year bond.</title>
<headline>Spain ICO to issue 15 bln pta in 29-1/2 year bond.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's state-owned Instituto de Credito Oficial (ICO) said on Wednesday it is finalising the launch of a 15 billion pesetas 29-1/2 year bond.</p>
<p>Bonds, with a minimum nominal value of 25 million pesetas and an yearly coupon of 6.75 percent, will mature on December 28 2026.</p>
<p>Societe Generale will be the sole lead manager of the issue, still pending authorisation from the national stock market commission CNMV.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
